@BeforeEach/@AfterEach per test, @BeforeAll/@AfterAll una volta (static).
@ParameterizedTest + @CsvSource = tabella EC/BVA eseguibile.
TDD: red → green → refactor. FIRST: fast, independent, repeatable, self-validating, timely.
Con Maven: src/test/java e mvn test.

